Copyright 2026 FlashDB-Zig contributors

This product includes a modified rewrite of concepts and algorithms from
FlashDB (https://github.com/armink/FlashDB), Copyright (c) 2020-2023 Armink,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The directory `reference/FlashDB/` contains an unmodified copy of FlashDB
2.2.99 and is not part of the library build; it is used only as a differential
test reference. The C programs under `bench/c/`, `firmware/c/` and
`firmware/common/` are measurement-harness code written for this project (they
link the unmodified upstream library for comparison).

The library itself (`src/`) is an independent Zig implementation and does not
contain upstream C code.
